{'symbol': 'ZION', 'date': '2023-05-05 13:06:00', 'title': "ZIONS BANCORPORATION'S BOARD DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK", 'text': "SALT LAKE CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ZIONS BANCORPORATION, N.A. (NASDAQ: ZION) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (“BOARD”) DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.41 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE MAY 25, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 18, 2023. ADDITIONALLY, THE BOARD DECLARED REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON THE COMPANY'S VARIOUS PERPETUAL PREFERRED SHARES, AS DETAILED BELOW. THE CASH DIVIDEND ON THE FOLLOWING SERIES ARE PAYABLE JUNE 15, 2023 TO SHAREHO."}